Error Response Format

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "error": "Error message",
  "code": "ERROR_CODE",
  "details": {...}
}
```

Common Playwright Commands

```javascript
// Navigation
await page.goto('https://example.com');
// Click
await page.click('button#submit');
// Fill input
await page.fill('input#email', 'test@example.com');
// Assert
await expect(page.locator('text=Welcome')).toBeVisible();
// Wait
await page.waitForSelector('.main-content');
```

Network Interception

Monitor and modify network requests:
```javascript
await page.route("**/api/data", (route) => {
  route.fulfill({ body: '{"mocked": true}' });
});
```

Screenshots and Videos

```javascript
await page.screenshot({ path: "screenshot.png" });
await context.tracing.start({ screenshots: true, snapshots: true });
```

Navigation

```javascript
// Go to URL
await page.goto("https://example.com");
// Wait for navigation
await page.waitForNavigation();
// Go back
await page.goBack();
```

Element Interaction

#### Click
```javascript
await page.click("button#submit");
await page.click("text=Login");
await page.click('[data-testid="buy-button"]');
```
#### Fill Forms
```javascript
await page.fill("input#email", "test@example.com");
await page.fill('input[name="password"]', "password123");
await page.type("textarea", "Long text...");
```
#### Select
```javascript
await page.selectOption("select#country", "USA");
await page.selectOption("select", { label: "Blue" });
```
#### Checkbox and Radio
```javascript
await page.check('input[type="checkbox"]');
await page.uncheck('input[type="checkbox"]');
await page.click('input[type="radio"][value="option1"]');
```

Assertions

#### Visibility
```javascript
await expect(page.locator("text=Welcome")).toBeVisible();
await expect(page.locator(".error")).toBeHidden();
```
#### Text Content
```javascript
await expect(page.locator("h1")).toHaveText("Dashboard");
await expect(page.locator(".message")).toContainText("Success");
```
#### Attributes
```javascript
await expect(page.locator("button")).toBeDisabled();
await expect(page.locator("button")).toBeEnabled();
await expect(page.locator("input")).toHaveValue("test@example.com");
```
#### Count
```javascript
await expect(page.locator(".item")).toHaveCount(5);
```

Waiting

#### Wait for Selector
```javascript
await page.waitForSelector(".content");
await page.waitForSelector("button", { state: "visible" });
```
#### Wait for URL
```javascript
await page.waitForURL("**/dashboard");
```
#### Wait for Load State
```javascript
await page.waitForLoadState("networkidle");
await page.waitForLoadState("domcontentloaded");
```
#### Custom Wait
```javascript
await page.waitForFunction(() => window.dataLoaded === true);
```

CSS Selectors

```javascript
"button#submit";
"input.email-field";
".container > .item";
'[data-testid="login-form"]';
```

Text Selectors

```javascript
"text=Login";
'text="Exact match"';
"text=/regex pattern/i";
```

Use Auto-Waiting

Don't use manual waits when possible:
```javascript
// ❌ Bad
await page.waitForTimeout(5000);
await page.click("button");
// ✅ Good
await page.click("button"); // Auto-waits
```

Use Locators

```javascript
// ✅ Better
const submitButton = page.locator("button#submit");
await submitButton.click();
await expect(submitButton).toBeVisible();
```

Handle Multiple Elements

```javascript
const items = page.locator(".item");
const count = await items.count();
for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {
  await items.nth(i).click();
}
```

Mobile Testing

```javascript
const iPhone = devices["iPhone 12"];
const context = await browser.newContext({
  ...iPhone,
});
const page = await context.newPage();
await page.goto("https://example.com");
```

Try-Catch

```javascript
try {
  await page.click("button", { timeout: 5000 });
} catch (error) {
  console.log("Button not found");
}
```

Soft Assertions

```javascript
await expect.soft(page.locator(".error")).toBeVisible();
// Test continues even if assertion fails
```

playwright.config.js

```javascript
export default {
  testDir: "./tests",
  timeout: 30000,
  retries: 2,
  use: {
    baseURL: "https://example.com",
    trace: "on-first-retry",
    screenshot: "only-on-failure",
  },
  projects: [
    { name: "chromium", use: { ...devices["Desktop Chrome"] } },
    { name: "firefox", use: { ...devices["Desktop Firefox"] } },
    { name: "webkit", use: { ...devices["Desktop Safari"] } },
  ],
};
```

Test Structure

```javascript
import { test, expect } from "@playwright/test";
test.describe("Login Flow", () => {
  test.beforeEach(async ({ page }) => {
    await page.goto("/login");
  });
  test("should login successfully", async ({ page }) => {
    await page.fill("input#email", "test@example.com");
    await page.fill("input#password", "password123");
    await page.click('button[type="submit"]');
    await expect(page).toHaveURL("/dashboard");
    await expect(page.locator("text=Welcome")).toBeVisible();
  });
  test("should show error for invalid credentials", async ({ page }) => {
    await page.fill("input#email", "wrong@example.com");
    await page.fill("input#password", "wrongpass");
    await page.click('button[type="submit"]');
    await expect(page.locator(".error")).toBeVisible();
    await expect(page.locator(".error")).toHaveText("Invalid credentials");
  });
});
```

Use Session Context:

```typescript
// Always load session context first
const sessionData = await getSessionWithProject(sessionId);
const projectUrl = sessionData?.project?.settings?.main_url;
// Use it if available
if (projectUrl) {
  // Don't ask for URL, just use it
}
```

When Missing Information:

**Priority Order:**
1. URL (most critical)
2. Scope (what to test)
3. Authentication (if needed)
4. Additional context (nice to have)
**Smart Detection:**
```typescript
// Check context first
const hasUrl = sessionProject?.url || messageContainsUrl(message);
const hasScope = intent?.scope || messageContainsScope(message);
// Only ask what's truly missing
if (!hasUrl) questions.push(urlQuestion);
if (!hasScope) questions.push(scopeQuestion);
// Don't ask if we can infer
if (messageContainsAuthKeywords(message)) {
  questions.push(authQuestion);
}
```

Always Mask Sensitive Data:

```typescript
// ❌ Bad
"Your API key: sk_live_abc123xyz";
// ✅ Good
"Your API key: sk_live_abc***xyz";
```

Progress Updates:

```typescript
// For long-running operations
emitProgress(sessionId, {
  phase: "analysis",
  progress: 30,
  message: "Analyzing page structure...",
});
emitProgress(sessionId, {
  phase: "execution",
  progress: 60,
  message: "Testing login form...",
});
```

Перехват сетевых запросов

Мониторинг и изменение сетевых запросов:
```javascript
await page.route("**/api/data", (route) => {
  route.fulfill({ body: '{"mocked": true}' });
});
```

Скриншоты и видео

```javascript
